{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/Voxyz_ai/status/2103117246860345550","id":"2103117246860345550","text":"I asked Opus 5.5 to explain gravitational lensing by building an interactive black hole lab\n\nOne prompt for the first version, then a dynamic workflow to polish it for three rounds while I slept. This is what I woke up to: 5h 28m end to end, $90 at API prices\n\nhttps://blackhole.voxyz.ai\n\nDrag the black hole and the sky behind it bends into arcs, closing into a full ring when everything lines up\n\nEach round ran 3 agents. Two reviewers each picked 9 to 10 issues and ranked them P0, P1, P2. The third one fixed them.\nRound 1: 3D materials and lighting + UI and type\nRound 2: camera motion and interaction + science-communication design\nRound 3: a design director deciding whether it ships + visual QA and performance\n\nEvery P0 got fixed, the rest only if worth it. When the two reviewers disagreed, it picked one and wrote down why. It backed up before each round, checked screenshots after, and rolled back anything it couldn't fix.","raw_text":{"text":"I asked Opus 5.5 to explain gravitational lensing by building an interactive black hole lab\n\nOne prompt for the first version, then a dynamic workflow to polish it for three rounds while I slept. This is what I woke up to: 5h 28m end to end, $90 at API prices\n\nhttps://t.co/BE1xui93rF\n\nDrag the black hole and the sky behind it bends into arcs, closing into a full ring when everything lines up\n\nEach round ran 3 agents. Two reviewers each picked 9 to 10 issues and ranked them P0, P1, P2. The third one fixed them.\nRound 1: 3D materials and lighting + UI and type\nRound 2: camera motion and interaction + science-communication design\nRound 3: a design director deciding whether it ships + visual QA and performance\n\nEvery P0 got fixed, the rest only if worth it. When the two reviewers disagreed, it picked one and wrote down why. It backed up before each round, checked screenshots after, and rolled back anything it couldn't fix.","display_text_range":[0,932],"facets":[{"type":"bold","indices":[181,194]},{"type":"bold","indices":[223,259]},{"type":"media","indices":[260,283],"id":"2103089211733680129","display":"pic.x.com/zDxGVclS8z","original":"https://t.co/zDxGVclS8z","replacement":"https://x.com/Voxyz_ai/status/2103117246860345550/video/1"},{"type":"url","indices":[261,284],"original":"https://t.co/BE1xui93rF","replacement":"https://blackhole.voxyz.ai","display":"blackhole.voxyz.ai"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Voxyz_ai","url":"https://x.com/Voxyz_ai","id":"1994077573694046208","followers":21788,"following":209,"likes":4206,"media_count":507,"name":"Vox","description":"Obsessed with getting AI to do real work.\nPracticing the AI-native future before it arrives.\nBuilds, model tests, prompts to copy.","raw_description":{"text":"Obsessed with getting AI to do real work.\nPracticing the AI-native future before it arrives.\nBuilds, model tests, prompts to copy.","facets":[]},"location":"London","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1994077573694046208/1790196505","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1998303259279138816/5bqsxKJS_200x200.jpg","joined":"Thu Nov 27 16:15:26 +0000 2025","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://www.voxyz.ai","display_url":"voxyz.ai"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":24,"retweets":66,"likes":626,"bookmarks":419,"quotes":11,"created_at":"Thu Sep 24 13:40:00 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790257200,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":83058,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"media":{"all":[{"id":"2103089211733680129","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2103089211733680129/vid/avc1/3840x2160/dFQg48Bq8XZwaOqX.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2103089211733680129/img/WGRwfXeWRCXEFHYi.jpg","duration":21.845,"width":3840